  m_text: 'You will have the short option to practice with the method.

    This
    is the so called <u>Circle</u> method. Depending on where you look a circle with
    you as center will be drawn. Objects farther away from the circle circumference
    will be muffled.


    Follow the purple marker.


    Green Cylinders are Sound
    sources. They will be invisible in the future.'
